  # 规则登记
  - elementId: rules-rule-top
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 290, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: rl1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 306, 864, 34]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">①</span> <strong>日志边界</strong>　状态日志自 ASSIGNED 起逐步写入 task_status_logs；发布任务与未接单取消不产生日志。</p>
  - elementId: rl1-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 348, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: rl2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 364, 864, 34]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">②</span> <strong>取消限制</strong>　仅发布者可取消且仅限 WAITING；已接单任务的取消须绑定当前接派记录并写入日志。</p>
  - elementId: rl2-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 406, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: rl3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 422, 864, 34]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">③</span> <strong>重派机制</strong>　保留旧接派记录并新增 REASSIGN 记录；支付、评价、投诉、结算始终绑定最新有效接派。</p>
  - elementId: rl3-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 464, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: rl4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 480, 864, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">④</span> <strong>并发抢单</strong>　FOR UPDATE 行锁 + 状态重读校验 + 唯一约束兜底，并发下仅一人成功。</p>
  - elementId: folio
    elementType: text
    bounds: [430, 514, 100, 14]
    content: {style: "$folio", align: [center, top], wrap: false, text: — 08 —}
